: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. F,H,E are collinear [07] & F,G,E are collinear [05] & EF ∥ AD [03] & AD ∥ BC [01] ⇒  BC ∥ GH [09]
002. BC ∥ GH [09] & B,D,G are collinear [06] & D,C,H are collinear [08] ⇒  DG:BD = HG:BC [10]
003. F,E,G are collinear [05] & EF ∥ AD [03] ⇒  DA ∥ GE [11]
004. DA ∥ GE [11] & B,D,G are collinear [06] & B,A,E are collinear [02] ⇒  DG:BD = AE:BA [12]
005. EF ∥ AD [03] & AD ∥ BC [01] ⇒  BC ∥ EF [13]
006. BC ∥ EF [13] & B,A,E are collinear [02] & C,F,A are collinear [04] ⇒  AE:BA = FE:BC [14]
007. DG:BD = HG:BC [10] & DG:BD = AE:BA [12] & AE:BA = FE:BC [14] ⇒  FE:BC = HG:BC [15]
008. FE:BC = HG:BC [15] & BC:BA = BC:BA [00] ⇒  FE = HG
